msgid "Yank release"
msgstr "Dra tillbaka utgåva"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:167
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yanking will mark this release (and %(count)s file within it) to be ignored "
"when installing in most common scenarios."
msgid_plural ""
"Yanking will mark this release (and %(count)s files within it) to be ignored"
" when installing in most common scenarios."
msgstr[0] ""
"En tillbakadragning gör att utgåvan och %(count)s fil i den ignoreras vid "
"installation i de flesta vanliga fall."
msgstr[1] ""
"En tillbakadragning gör att utgåvan och %(count)s filer i den ignoreras vid "
"installation i de flesta vanliga fall."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:173
msgid ""
"Yanking will mark this release to be ignored when installing in most common "
"scenarios."
msgstr ""
"En tillbakadragning gör att denna utgåva ignoreras vid installation i de "
"flesta vanliga fall."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:177
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This release will still be installable for users pinning to this exact "
"version, e.g. when using <code>%(project_name)s==%(version)s</code>."
msgstr ""
"Denna utgåva kan fortfarande installeras av användare som låser till just "
"denna version, till exempel med <code>%(project_name)s==%(version)s</code>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:180
#, python-format
msgid "For more information, see <a href=\"%(href)s\">PEP 592</a>."
msgstr "Se <a href=\"%(href)s\">PEP 592</a> för mer information."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:186
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/releases.html:134
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You may provide a reason for yanking this release, which will be displayed "
"by pip to users who install <code>%(project_name)s==%(version)s</code>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange en orsak till att utgåvan dras tillbaka. pip visar den för "
"användare som installerar <code>%(project_name)s==%(version)s</code>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:202
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:230
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/releases.html:148
msgid "Delete release"
msgstr "Ta bort utgåva"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:206
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Deleting will irreversibly delete this release along with %(count)s file."
msgid_plural ""
"Deleting will irreversibly delete this release along with %(count)s files."
msgstr[0] "När du tar bort utgåvan raderas även %(count)s fil permanent."
msgstr[1] "När du tar bort utgåvan raderas även %(count)s filer permanent."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:212
msgid "Deleting will irreversibly delete this release."
msgstr "Om du tar bort den går utgåvan inte att återställa."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:215
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/releases.html:151
msgid ""
"You will not be able to re-upload a new distribution of the same type with "
"the same version number."
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte ladda upp en ny distribution av samma typ med samma "
"versionsnummer igen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:218
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/releases.html:154
msgid ""
"Deletion will break any downstream projects relying on a pinned version of "
"this package. It is intended as a last resort to address legal issues or "
"remove harmful releases."
msgstr ""
"En borttagning gör att projekt längre ned i beroendekedjan som förlitar sig "
"på en låst version av paketet slutar fungera. Åtgärden är en sista utväg för"
" juridiska problem eller för att ta bort skadliga utgåvor."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/release.html:221
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/releases.html:157
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Consider <a href=\"%(yank_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
